\subsection{Per-Attack-Type Analysis}

Table~\ref{tab:per_attack} shows ACER broken down by attack type.
BBDM achieves the best ACER on 6 of 8 attack types.
CNN classifiers outperform on E-display and Print+E-display,
where display-based texture is easier to classify via supervised
features. BBDM achieves near-perfect detection of PostMortem
(6.63\% ACER) and Artifact (19.23\%) attacks without any attack
supervision.

